						 <p>I really liked some of the description of impossible stuff, but&#8230; the whole thing is pretty 'eh'. Ruiz is boring as hell, honestly, and it feels like the story really really wants us to think he's, well, cool. The Critic is equally boring, minus his supernatural insight. And the logic behind the story and its twists&#8230; eh.</p> 
