					<![CDATA[
						 <p>I think I prefer Wowee when it's 100% mundane and just an art piece about expectation of safety and curiosity, rather than an anomalous doomsday machine. Here, it's pretty darn generic and boring. Also, I'd expect a little more out of Nobody. Both Ruiz and Pico seem like kind of small potatoes.</p> 
				 	]]>
