				<wikidot:authorName>UglyFlower</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>1741178</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>This might sound silly, but you are breaking your own canon in this one.</p> <blockquote> <p>&quot;Nothing. Felix, this blade does absolutely nothing, and it’s the finest thing I’ve made in my entire life. I’ve got enough deadly bullshit in here to kill a country, and absolutely none of it breaks reality, and this is what I am going to show to The Critic.&quot;</p> </blockquote> <p>You state in a prequel that it doesn't break reality, but a dimension defying &quot;impossible to life&quot; sewn together blade does indeed break reality. Just thought I'd point this out.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
